WEBVTT

00:16:54.558 --> 00:17:00.174
i mislim da ću vas uveriti kulturom.

00:17:00.198 --> 00:17:03.078
(Smeh)

00:17:03.102 --> 00:17:05.229
(Aplauz)

00:17:05.253 --> 00:17:06.779
Donesite mi moj mač!

00:17:06.803 --> 00:17:11.015
(Aplauz)

00:17:11.039 --> 00:17:12.897
Gutanje mača...

00:17:12.921 --> 00:17:14.180
(Smeh)

00:17:14.204 --> 00:17:16.164
je iz drevne Indije.

00:17:16.188 --> 00:17:17.737
(Smeh)

00:17:17.761 --> 00:17:21.675
To je kulturni izraz
koji je hiljadama godina

00:17:21.699 --> 00:17:26.869
nadahnjivao ljude
da razmišljaju izvan očiglednog.

00:17:26.893 --> 00:17:29.300
(Smeh)

00:17:29.324 --> 00:17:34.427
A ja ću vam sada dokazati
da je naizgled nemoguće moguće